	"title": "Connect 0.1.0-0055",
	"body": "<!-- synopkgland:release:synopackageland%2FSynoPkgConnect:0.1.0-0055 -->\n\nConnect **0.1.0-0055**\n\n0.1.0-0055\n- Rebuilt on SDK 0.13.1 and UI 0.11.4 with refreshed UI components.\n- Fixed the iPhone Portal/standalone layout through the updated UI.\n- Upgrading from 0.1.0-0054 needs no administrator approval.\n\nPackage: `synopackageland/SynoPkgConnect`\n\n[Browse packages](https://synopkgland.com/apps/)\n\n",
	"bodyHTML": "\n<p dir=\"auto\">Connect <strong>0.1.0-0055</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">0.1.0-0055</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Rebuilt on SDK 0.13.1 and UI 0.11.4 with refreshed UI components.</li>\n<li>Fixed the iPhone Portal/standalone layout through the updated UI.</li>\n<li>Upgrading from 0.1.0-0054 needs no administrator approval.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Package: <code class=\"notranslate\">synopackageland/SynoPkgConnect</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://synopkgland.com/apps/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Browse packages</a></p>",
